    desc: "One query pulls every accepted friendship touching one of my friends, avoiding an N+1 lookup per friend. Whichever side isn't already my friend becomes a candidate and gains +1 mutual_friends.",
  },
  {
    n: 3,
    title: "Signal B: shared parks",
    desc: "The algorithm matches every park I've actually visited (excluding bucket-list-only entries) against other visitors of those same parks, adding +1 shared_parks per overlap. This domain-specific signal is something a generic social graph wouldn't have.",
  },
  {
